{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a7b89aa9dc5a833da063","chatId":"6d3243e380d947cda22a9cd9e7d96a87","sessionId":null,"userId":99749,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":4632,"promptTokens":504,"completionTokens":85,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:49:12"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004607463441960788,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7b89aa9dc5a833da062","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484152383,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:49:12","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a7b89aa9dc5a833da062","chatId":"6d3243e380d947cda22a9cd9e7d96a87","sessionId":null,"userId":99749,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小劳拥有一家面包店。最近，她有机会参加一场备受关注的全国烘焙比赛。经过数周的艰苦准备，她成功进入了决赛，但不幸地获得了第二名。尽管如此，她的烘焙偶像，一位著名的糕点大厨，对她的工作给予了赞扬。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小劳最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 失望 & 惊喜\nB) 伤心 & 充满希望\nC) 惊喜 & 自豪\nD) 惊喜 & 充满希望\nE) 失望 & 紧张\nF) 伤心 & 自豪\n\n## 问题 2\n小劳为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她发现了一种新的烘焙技术 & 她从比赛中赚了很多钱\nB) 她在最后一轮无法使用她最喜欢的食材 & 她发现了一种新的烘焙技术\nC) 她受到了偶像的赞扬 & 她从比赛中赚了很多钱\nD) 尽管她努力了，但是还是没有赢得比赛 & 她受到了偶像的赞扬\nE) 尽管她努力了，但是还是没有赢得比赛 & 评审们不喜欢她的烘焙风格\nF) 她受到了偶像的赞扬 & 她发现了一种新的烘焙技术","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004607463441960788,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7b89aa9dc5a833da063","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484152380,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:49:12","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"e6203eb73dd44c4ea220579b5eb4b64c"}